@startuml branching-model
' The feature-branch model.
'
' Source of record: the
' "Branching & PR workflow" section of CLAUDE.md.
' The pre-commit hook renders the PNG for any staged .puml automatically.
'
' Drawn as a sequence diagram because a branch is a lifeline: time runs
' downwards, and each arrow is a branch being cut or a PR being merged.

title Branching model

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #999999
  ParticipantBorderColor #999999
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #BBBBBB
  GroupBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
}

participant "main" as main #F0FFF0
participant "feature/001-example\n(spec or work package)" as feat #F0F6FF
participant "001-example\n(task: specify to analyze)" as t1
participant "task branch\n(a user story)" as t2
participant "fix/812-...\n(fix for this feature)" as fx
participant "fix/815-...\n(production fix)" as pfx #FFF0F0

== Promotion ==
main -> feat : cut at promotion and pushed\n({{SKILL_PREFIX}}-promote-backlog-spec, {{SKILL_PREFIX}}-promote-wp)\n**Target branch** written into the document

== Work on the feature ==
feat -> t1 : cut by /speckit.specify\nrun from the feature branch
t1 -> feat : PR, squash-merged\ntask tier: per-file checks on changed files
feat -> t2 : cut
t2 -> feat : PR, squash-merged\npest only if the operator asks

feat -> fx : cut by {{SKILL_PREFIX}}-fix-branch\n(operator chose this feature)
fx -> feat : PR, squash-merged\nno pest: the feature merge tests it

== Meanwhile, on main ==
main -> pfx : cut by {{SKILL_PREFIX}}-fix-branch\n(operator chose main)
pfx -> main : PR, squash-merged\npest **mandatory**: nothing later catches it

main -> feat : merged in when there is a reason\n(never rebased)

== Release gate ==
feat -> main : one PR, squash-merged ({{SKILL_PREFIX}}-merge, feature merge)\nfull checks, larastan and pest run without a label\nmigration order checked against main

note over main
  Merging the release-please PR
  publishes the release and fires
  the deploy, as before.
end note

@enduml
